
### Get all blogs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs

### Get a blog by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/1

### Create a new blog
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Fawa",
  "url": "https://test.com/",
  "title": "test",
  "likes": 5
}

### Create a blog without likes (should default to 0)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "musab",
  "url": "https://react.dev/",
  "title": "Learning React"
}

### Update a blog
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Farwa",
  "url": "https://example.com/updated",
  "title": "Updated Blog Title",
  "likes": 15
}

### Delete a blog
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/5

### Get the deleted blog (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/2
